@baseUrl = http://localhost:1506
@token   = eyJhbGciOiJIUzI1NiIsInR5cCI6IkpXVCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJ0ZXN0LXN0dWRlbnQtMTIzIiwiaWF0IjoxNzc5MzAwNDQyLCJleHAiOjE4MTA4MzY0NDJ9.DyEAdg9JdUjcynjusIlcPgcqPvmHYdN0Ccrpfs_6zoY
@subjectId = 1

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Health check
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Health — verifica que el servicio está vivo
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# R20 | GET /api/stats/dashboard
# Agrega datos de academic-service + task-service en un solo response.
# El userId se extrae del claim "sub" del JWT — no hace falta parámetro extra.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Dashboard — happy path (espera: overall_gpa, gpa_trend, subjects[], tasks{})
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Dashboard — sin token (espera 401 Unauthorized)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/dashboard
Accept: application/json

###

### Dashboard — entorno QA
GET https://aibert-stats-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io/api/stats/dashboard
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# R21 | GET /api/stats/subjects
# Estadísticas de todas las materias del estudiante autenticado.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Todas las materias — happy path
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/subjects
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Todas las materias — sin token (espera 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/subjects
Accept: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# R21 | GET /api/stats/subjects/{subject_id}
# Estadísticas detalladas de una materia específica.
# subject_id es el ID numérico (Long) de academic-service — p.ej. 1, 2, 3.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Materia por ID — happy path
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Materia por ID — no existe (espera 404)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/subjects/999
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Materia por ID — sin token (espera 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Materia por ID — entorno QA
GET https://aibert-stats-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io/api/stats/subjects/{{subjectId}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# R24 | GET /api/stats/gamification
# Perfil de gamificación: puntos, nivel, badges, progreso al siguiente nivel.
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────

### Gamificación — happy path (espera: total_points, current_level, badges[], progress_to_next)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/gamification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###

### Gamificación — sin token (espera 401)
GET {{baseUrl}}/api/stats/gamification
Accept: application/json

###

### Gamificación — entorno QA
GET https://aibert-stats-service-qa.yellowwave-cb2d91fc.centralus.azurecontainerapps.io/api/stats/gamification
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
